'''Starry''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing the [[2026 Valentine's Box]] for 30 [[Heart Gems]] [[File:Heart Gem.png|25x25px]]or 60 [[Diamonds|Gems]] [[File:Diamond_icon.png|25x25px]] during the [[Valentines Event 2026|2026 Valentine's Day Event]].

== Appearance ==
The blade is a purple to light purple night sky gradient with clouds, stars, and a crescent moon. The guard is purple and the handle is solid black.
